# The browser suite runs with Turnstile off. The dev worker has no TURNSTILE_SECRET, so it skips
# verification server-side anyway; leaving the widget on would only leave the submit button
# disabled behind a challenge no test can solve. Mode files outrank .env.local, so this holds even
# on a machine that has a real site key for manual dev.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
